<section class="tsru-config-section tsru-multitype-settings" data-settings-page="combat" data-multitype-actor-uuid="{{actor.uuid}}" data-setting-keywords="multitype multi type elemental change swap switch attack spell damage toughness weakness NPC PC summon creature">
  <h3><i class="fas fa-shuffle"></i> Multitype &amp; Element Change</h3>
  {{#if includeElement}}<div class="tsru-field tsru-field-wide"><label for="{{controlId}}-element"><strong>Assigned Element</strong><small>This Actor’s current HSR Element. Used by ordinary attacks and inherited attack assignments. Define available Elements in the Element Manager.</small></label><select id="{{controlId}}-element" name="elementId" data-multitype-base-element>{{#each elements}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></div>{{/if}}
  <div class="tsru-field tsru-field-toggle"><label for="{{controlId}}-enabled" class="tsru-field-label"><strong>Multitype?</strong><small>Enable one of two Element systems for this Actor. Available to PCs, NPCs and summons on every Path. Turning it off keeps saved attack assignments and the last selected Actor Element.</small></label><input id="{{controlId}}-enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" name="multitypeEnabled" {{checked config.multitypeEnabled}}></div>
  <div data-multitype-fields data-settings-group {{#unless config.multitypeEnabled}}hidden{{/unless}}>
    <div class="tsru-field tsru-field-wide"><label for="{{controlId}}-mode"><strong>Multitype mode</strong><small>Switch off for independent attack Elements, or on to change the entire Actor’s current Element. Only one mode applies at a time; saved attack choices are retained.</small></label><div class="tsru-multitype-mode"><span data-multitype-mode-label="attacks">Multitype attacks</span><input id="{{controlId}}-mode" name="multitypeMode" type="checkbox" role="switch" aria-label="Type Changer mode" {{checked changer}}><span data-multitype-mode-label="changer">Type Changer</span></div></div>
    <div class="tsru-field tsru-field-wide" data-multitype-mode-panel="attacks" {{#if changer}}hidden{{/if}}><strong>Independent attack Elements</strong><p>Assign an HSR Element to each owned Item or individual activity. Unassigned activities inherit their Item; unassigned Items inherit this Actor. Matching attacks reduce the target’s Toughness through the normal rules.</p><button type="button" data-multitype-attacks="{{actor.uuid}}"><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Assign attack Elements</button></div>
    <div class="tsru-field tsru-field-wide" data-multitype-mode-panel="changer" {{#unless changer}}hidden{{/unless}}><label for="{{controlId}}-live"><strong>Change Element now</strong><small>GM only. Changes this specific Actor immediately, including its HSR visuals and the Element used by future attacks. Does not change weaknesses, Path or D&amp;D5e damage types. Rolls already made keep their captured Element.</small></label><select id="{{controlId}}-live" data-element-change="{{actor.uuid}}">{{#each elements}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select><p>Also available in Star Rail GM Panel → Element Change and DM Combat → Element Change.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="tsru-multitype-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-multitype-status></p>
</section>
